Subject: [PATCH 1/2] describe lowercase tool names in agent status labels

Pi and other agents name their tools read, write, edit, bash, grep, glob,
web_search and task, with the file in `path` rather than `file_path`.
These were shown verbatim; they now get the same labels as Claude Code's
tools.

